      "type": "text",
      "id": "v8_desc",
      "x": 1001,
      "y": 780.5,
      "width": 408,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "Reviewer subagents check generated output for formatting issues, ATS problems, and tone mismatches. Quality comes from verification, not from hoping the first pass was right.",
