    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "v10_desc",
      "x": 1929,
      "y": 780.5,
      "width": 408,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "When specific data isn't available (comp ranges, interview processes), fall back to realistic industry standards — so every answer is useful and grounded, never empty.",
